  "details": "I'd like something that lets me hide installed packages so I can hide unused packages that get bundled with X-User's VPM package bundle.\n\nAdditionally, being able to make a sort of folder system for my ever growing huge list of VPM packages would be useful too.\n\nI have a ton from VRLabs for example that could be grouped together.\n\nOr I could divide them based on Worlds and Avatars.\n\nHaving the ability to \"nickname\" the packages I have installed would help here too, so I can disambiguate between tools like EasyQuestSwitch and VRCQuestTools, one of which is for Avatars and one for Worlds, but you couldn't tell from those names :)",
